# services/
#
# Business-logic layer. Controllers stay thin and call services here.
# Each feature gets its own file, e.g.:
#   - farmer.service.ts
#   - product.service.ts
#   - upload.service.ts   (wraps Cloudinary)
#
# Services contain the "how" (DB queries, external calls, rules); controllers
# only handle the HTTP request/response and call into services.
